Layer Responsibilities
Layer	Schema	Purpose
RAW	OLIST_ECOMMERCE.RAW	Stores ingested source data with no transformation. Exact copy of CSV files.
STAGING	OLIST_ECOMMERCE.STAGING	Cleans, standardizes, and enriches data. Adds computed columns like delivery days, total item value, English category names.
CORE	OLIST_ECOMMERCE.CORE	Dimensional model (Star Schema). Fact table at order-item grain with surrogate keys linking to dimension tables.
ANALYTICS	OLIST_ECOMMERCE.ANALYTICS	Pre-aggregated business views. Ready for dashboards and reporting with no additional joins required.
