Snowflake Environment
Warehouse Configuration
CREATE WAREHOUSE IF NOT EXISTS OLIST_WH
WITH
    WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'XSMALL'
    AUTO_SUSPEND = 60
    AUTO_RESUME = TRUE
    INITIALLY_SUSPENDED = TRUE;
Setting	Value	Rationale
Size	X-Small	Sufficient for this dataset size; minimizes credit consumption
Auto-Suspend	60 seconds	Avoids idle compute charges
Auto-Resume	TRUE	Warehouse starts automatically when queries arrive
Initially Suspended	TRUE	No cost until first query
