Why Star Schema?
Simplified queries — analysts join fact to dimensions without complex multi-hop joins
Performance — denormalized dimensions reduce join depth
Business-friendly — maps directly to how business users think about data
Dashboard-ready — Power BI and other tools work optimally with star schemas
