Snowflake Features Used
Feature	How It Was Used
Virtual Warehouse	OLIST_WH (X-Small) for all compute
Multi-Schema Architecture	4 schemas separating data lifecycle stages
File Format	CSV_FORMAT for standardized parsing
COPY INTO (via Snowsight)	Bulk data loading from CSV
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS	Protects RAW data from accidental overwrites
CREATE OR REPLACE (STAGING/CORE)	Enables idempotent pipeline reruns
Time Travel	Used to recover data after accidental table recreation
UNDROP TABLE	Restored tables from Time Travel history
CTAS (CREATE TABLE AS SELECT)	Materializes transformations as physical tables
Window Functions	ROW_NUMBER() for deduplication (primary payment)
GENERATOR	Creates DIM_DATE calendar without external data
Data Engineering Challenges
Challenge	Solution
9 related CSV files with no unified key	Designed Star Schema to consolidate relationships
Portuguese category names	LEFT JOIN with translation table, COALESCE for fallback
Accidental data wipe from CREATE OR REPLACE	Changed to IF NOT EXISTS; recovered via Time Travel + UNDROP
Inconsistent text formatting (case, whitespace)	Applied INITCAP, UPPER, TRIM in STAGING
NULL values across datasets	NULL_IF in file format + WHERE IS NOT NULL filters
Multiple payments per order	Window function to identify primary payment method
Customer deduplication	Grouped by customer_unique_id in DIM_CUSTOMERS
Missing delivery dates (non-delivered orders)	Computed columns return NULL gracefully; analytics filter on delivered
Cost Optimization
Practice	Impact
X-Small warehouse	Minimum credit consumption (1 credit/hour)
Auto-Suspend = 60s	Warehouse stops within 1 minute of inactivity
Auto-Resume	No manual intervention needed
Initially Suspended	No cost until first query runs
IF NOT EXISTS for RAW	Avoids unnecessary recreation and reloading
CTAS over INSERT loops	Single-pass transformations; faster and cheaper
